:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Arrival
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<if $avery_fate is "ascended">><<location "avery_skyscraper">><<else>><<location "office">><</if>><<effects>>
<<if !$avery_party or $avery_mansion.party_state isnot "started">>
	<<avery_mansion_party_init>>
<</if>>
<<npc "Avery" 1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
"Stay where people can see you with me, but don't hover. Tonight you're here to improve your image. Mine as well." Avery stops near the entrance while guests pass in satin, silk, and tailored wool.
<br><br>
At the other end of the room, a quiet auction is already under way. Guests talk over their bids while staff carry cards and drinks between the tables.
<br><br>
"Be polite to the matron managing the scholarship fund. Speak to the donors and look housebroken. And when I ask, carry a message without making anything up. Do it properly and people might start describing you as promising instead of decorative," <<person1>><<he>> says.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
<br>

