:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Task Matron
<<effects>><<person2>>
You approach the older <<person>> overseeing the scholarship display. <<He>> wears a diamond necklace and greets you with a polite smile.
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
	You offer a careful greeting, then praise the students being supported this year.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	You offer a careful greeting, then praise the students being supported this year.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You introduce yourself quietly and ask about the students receiving scholarships this year.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You keep your voice polite, just as Avery told you, and ask how the scholarship fund helps the students.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You introduce yourself properly, compliment the display, and ask about the scholarship fund.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You introduce yourself and ask which parts of the scholarship fund need the most support.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You flash a practised smile and ask which scholarship attracts the most competitive donors.
<<else>>
	You introduce yourself politely and ask about the scholarship fund.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The matron becomes friendlier as you listen and ask questions. When you finally excuse yourself, <<he>> smiles and tells you it was nice speaking with you.
<br><br>
Across the room, <<person1>>Avery gives you a small approving nod.
<br><br><<famesocial 5>>
<<run $avery_party.hbsc.tasks.pushUnique("matron")>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Task Donors
<<effects>>
You move between the smaller donors gathered around the champagne and auction cards. They talk about huge donations in the same calm voices they use to discuss dinner.
<br><br>
You laugh when expected and nod through several conversations about family names and donations. More than one person looks you over before asking how you know Avery.
<br><br>
One of them remarks that Avery seems to be keeping better company lately. It takes you a second to realise they mean you.
<br><br><<famesocial 5>>
<<run $avery_party.hbsc.tasks.pushUnique("donors")>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Task Message
<<effects>>
Avery stops you as you pass and hands you a folded card, then tells you exactly what to say.
"To the trustee in green. Tell <<person3>><<him>> that the revised figure is acceptable, but only if the naming rights remain under discussion. Repeat it exactly. If your imagination stirs, kill it."
<br><br>
You repeat Avery's message exactly. The trustee reads the card, then gives you a nod. "Tell Avery we have an understanding," <<he>> says.
<br><br>
When you return, Avery gives you a small smile. "See? You can be useful without causing a scene."
<br><br><<famesocial 5>>
<<run $avery_party.hbsc.tasks.pushUnique("message")>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Murmurs
<<effects>>
On your way back across the room, you hear two people talking behind a half-closed service door.
"Not on the main floor. The manager wants the ordinary stock displayed, not those."
<br>
"Then keep the anti separate," another voice answers, lower. "You want one of the donors swallowing the wrong thing?"
<br><br>
You stop walking and listen.
<br><br>
A waiter passes between you and the door, giving you a chance to move closer without being noticed. Through the gap, you see two well-dressed strangers with a bank employee. Several cases are open on the sideboard, and one contains pills in familiar colours.
<span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get closer|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Investigation]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Step away and ignore it|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Ignore]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Investigation
<<effects>>
You step into the service corridor and stay behind a column where they cannot easily see you. Their voices are clearer from here.
"The demonstration cases stay sealed. <span class="elk">The owner</span> doesn't want improvisation tonight. The charity is for upstairs. The real clients come later."
<br><br>
One of the strangers opens another velvet box, checks what is inside, and puts a single pill case to one side. You recognise the label. It is not one of the standard transformation pills.
<span class="green">But an anti pill.</span>
<br><br>
/* Brown fox HBSC Gala task: discovering the hidden cache counts as success */
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.task is "HBSC Gala">>
	<<set $avery_mansion.fox.task_complete to "success">>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Investigation 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Investigation 2
<<effects>>
The case is left near the corner of the sideboard while the three of them argue over the rest of the stock.
<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	But your hands twitch uselessly. <span class="red">You can't steal anything with both arms bound.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Back away|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Ignore]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	/* Set skulduggerydifficulty here so the skulduggerydifficulty gauge below reflects THIS steal, not a stale value left over from lockpicking or another skulduggery action. */
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $skulduggerydifficulty>>
		<span class="green">You could probably lift it before they look back.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">It would take quick, careful fingers to steal it cleanly.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Try to take the anti pill|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave it and return to the gala|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Ignore]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal
<<effects>>
You wait until one stranger turns to argue with the other and the employee looks towards the hall.
<br><br>
/* Use the standard skulduggery check (difficulty 1000) so odds scale smoothly with skill and match the gauge shown on the previous screen. At S rank the gap guaranteeing success; a still-caught path exists for lower skill. */
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 and !pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	Your hand darts out and back again in one smooth motion. The case disappears into your sleeve before anyone turns.
	<br><br>
	<<set $avery_party.hbsc.pillTaken to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Success]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Your fingers brush the case instead of getting a proper grip on it.
	<br><br>
	"Hey...!"
	<br><br>
	A hand clamps around your wrist. Another seizes your shoulder. The service door swings shut behind you as they drag you out of sight.
	<br><br>
	<<set $avery_party.hbsc.failed to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Fail]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Success
<<effects>>
You keep walking until you are back among the guests, where the people around you block the service door from view.
<br><br>
Once you are safely back in the crowd, you look down at the case hidden in your palm. You have seen cases like this before, but you still want to know exactly what you stole.
<br><br>

/* RNG roll */
<<set _roll to random(1,100)>>
/* Decide which Choice Reversal would be valid/visible for the current PC */
<<set _choiceValid to V.xchange.pill.choiceEffect>>
<<set _choiceKey to "">>
<<if _choiceValid>>
	<<set _choiceKey to (($xchange.pill.originalBody?.sex || $player.sex) is "m") ? "X-Change Choice Reversal (F)" : "X-Change Choice Reversal (M)">>
<</if>>
/* Build SWP Anti pill candidates */
<<set _antiKeys to Object.keys($sexStats.pills["pills"]).filter(k => k.startsWith("SWP Anti-") && k.endsWith(" Pill"))>>
/* Pick the reward */
<<if _choiceValid and _roll lte 25>>
	<<set _giftKey to _choiceKey>>
<<else>>
	<<set _giftKey to (_antiKeys.length gt 0) ? _antiKeys[random(0, _antiKeys.length - 1)] : "X-Change Choice Reversal (F)">>
<</if>>
/* Ensure entry exists */
<<run if (V.sexStats.pills && V.sexStats.pills.pills && V.sexStats.pills.pills[_giftKey] === undefined) V.sexStats.pills.pills[_giftKey] = { autoTake:false, doseTaken:0, owned:0, overdose:0 }; >>
/* Increment owned safely */
<<if $sexStats.pills["pills"][_giftKey].owned is undefined>>
	<<set $sexStats.pills["pills"][_giftKey].owned to 0>>
<</if>>
<<set $sexStats.pills["pills"][_giftKey].owned to $sexStats.pills["pills"][_giftKey].owned + 1>>
<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
<<set $avery_party.hbsc.giftKey to _giftKey>>

You open the case just enough to confirm what you've taken. <span class="green">It's the <<= _giftKey>>.</span>
<br><br>
Avery is still across the room, speaking to a trustee.
<br><br>
<<if !$avery_mansion.hbsc_gala_seen>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Show]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Hide]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Show
<<effects>>
<<set $avery_party.hbsc.pillShown to true>><<person1>>
/* TODO: Make raid event using this check: */ <<set $hbsc.galaAntiPillStolen to true>>
When Avery comes back within reach, you hide the case between your hands and show it to <<him>>.
<br><br>
Avery stops walking. <<He>> looks down at the case, then back at you. <<His>> eyes narrow before moving towards the service corridor. <<He>> recognises the <span class="lewd">pill</span>, and <<he>> knows where you found it.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Show 2]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Show 2
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	"You stole that here." Avery takes the case from your hand, reads the label, then pushes it firmly back into your grip.
	<br><br>
	"Do you understand what you've just done?" <<He>> lowers <<his>> voice. "<span class="elk">The owner's</span> people were moving pills through their own charity event, and you got past them without being noticed."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks towards the service corridor. "That means there are holes in their security. Someone patient could make use of that."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> turns back to you. "I should be furious with you for taking that kind of risk in front of half the donors in this city. But I'm not, because you've just shown me something nobody else at this gala could.
	Keep it hidden."<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 60 and C.npc.Avery.rage lt 20>>
	"Look at you. You walked into <span class="elk">the owner</span>'s bank, past <span class="elk">the owner</span>'s people, lifted one of <span class="elk">the owner</span>'s pills, and came back to me with it like a cat dropping a bird on the doorstep." 
	<br><br>
	Avery presses the case shut between your hands with <<his>> thumb. "You know what this means, don't you? The pill itself isn't important; anyone with the money can get one. What matters is that you stole it here. Their people missed you on their own ground, at their own event."
	<br><br>
	Avery smiles. "If someone like you can get that far in, then perhaps <span class="elk">the owner</span> isn't quite so untouchable as everyone pretends. Keep the pill; you've earned it, and you've given me something far more valuable than medicine tonight."<<npcincr Avery love 2>><<gglove>>
<<else>>
	Avery looks at the case and stops mid-step. When <<he>> speaks, <<he>> keeps <<his>> voice low.
	<br><br>
	"You took this from the back rooms." <<He>> turns so that <<his>> body blocks the case from the rest of the room. "From <span class="elk">the owner</span>'s people."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> leaves the case in your hand, but keeps looking at it. "Everyone in this room will tell you <span class="elk">the owner</span> is untouchable and their operation never makes mistakes. Yet here you are with one of their pills, and you don't even own a proper suit."
	<br><br>
	Avery smiles. "I was beginning to think tonight would only give me speeches and bad wine. Instead, you've shown me a real weakness in their security." <<He>> straightens your collar. "Well done."<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Good]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Success Hide
<<effects>><<person1>>
You put the case away, take a breath, and return to Avery as though nothing happened.
"There you are. I was about to decide whether you'd wandered off on purpose or by instinct."
<br><br>
You apologise and take your place beside <<him>> again. Avery says nothing, but you notice <<him>> looking at you several times as the evening continues.
<br><br>
You spend the rest of the evening beside Avery, listening to speeches and making polite conversation with people you barely know.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Fail
<<effects>><<person1>>
They drag you through a side door and into a private office lined with ledgers and locked cabinets. The bank employee no longer bothers smiling.
<br><br>
One of the strangers twists your arm higher until pain sparks up to your shoulder.
"Thought you were clever? Do you have any idea whose floor you're sneaking around on?"
<br><br>
Before you can answer, the office door opens.
<br><br>
Avery steps in. <<His>> expression could freeze blood. "There you are," <<he>> says, not looking at you first. "I was wondering why my evening had grown quieter."
<br><br>
The bank employee lets go of you immediately. "This one was caught trying to steal from restricted stock."
<br><br>
Avery checks the sideboard, then turns back to the people holding you. "How embarrassing. My companion went somewhere <<pshe>> <<pverb "was not" "were not">> meant to, while you were keeping restricted stock in a locked office at a charity gala."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Fail 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Steal Fail 2
<<effects>><<person1>>
Nobody answers.
<br><br>
"I'm taking <<phim>> off your hands," Avery says. "Unless you'd prefer I repeat that sentence in front of the trustees."
<br><br>
No one stops <<him>> when <<he>> takes hold of your arm roughly and marches you into the corridor.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Fail Avery]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Fail Avery
<<effects>><<person1>>
Avery does not stop until <<he>> has pulled you into a quiet corner overlooking the banking hall. The music is quieter here, and <<he>> grips your arm harder.<<pain 2>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	"What," <<he>> asks quietly, "possessed you to humiliate me in a room full of donors?"
	<br><br>
	"You don't get caught stealing from a bank gala and expect me to find it charming. I had to step between you and a very ugly conversation."
	<br><br>
	"You should explain exactly what piece of your brain failed first. But no need, your brain indeed as slow as that." <<He>> leans close. "You will stay at my side for the rest of the evening. You will smile when spoken to."
	<<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<npcincr Avery love -2>><<ggarage>><<lllove>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 60 and C.npc.Avery.rage lt 20>>
	Avery closes <<his>> eyes and exhales. "You are lucky I noticed you were gone."
	<br><br>
	When <<he>> opens <<his>> eyes, <<he>> loosens <<his>> grip on your arm. "If you wanted something, you should have come to me. Instead you chose the one method guaranteed to make me pull you out of trouble by the wrist like an unruly child.
	Don't make me do that again."<<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<garage>><<llove>>
<<else>>
	Avery gives you a thin smile. "I bring you here to improve your image, and you vanish into a service corridor to poke around restricted stock. Do you understand how vulgar that is?"
	<br><br>
	<<He>> tugs your clothes back into place. "You will remain visible for the rest of the evening. I refuse to spend another ten minutes wondering which locked room you've disgraced me in."
	<<npcincr Avery rage 2>><<npcincr Avery love -2>><<ggarage>><<lllove>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
You return to the gala with Avery close beside you. Whenever you move more than a few steps away, <<he>> looks over to check where you are.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Bad]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Ignore
<<effects>><<person1>>
You leave the service door alone. Whatever they are doing back there, getting involved could easily end badly.
<br><br>
When you return, Avery turns towards you.
<br><br>
"Back already?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I thought it wiser not to cause a scene," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I thought it wiser not to cause a scene," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I heard something, but... I thought I should leave it alone," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I remembered what you told me and came back," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I decided it was better not to interfere," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I heard them talking, but there was no point risking a scene," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I decided not to snoop in a bank full of rich idiots," you say.
<<else>>
	"I decided not to interfere," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage lt 20>>
	Avery gives a small nod. "Good. Knowing when to leave something alone is useful."
	<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	Avery hums. "Prudent. For once."
<<else>>
	"A pity," Avery says. "But keeping out of trouble suits you better tonight."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Avery
<<effects>><<person1>>
You return to Avery's side. <<He>> glances at you, then gives a small smile when you stay beside <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<if $avery_party.hbsc.tasks.length is 0>>
	"Already?" <<he>> asks. "Go make yourself useful."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $avery_party.hbsc.tasks.length is 1>>
	"One task completed is not a triumph," Avery says. "Try again."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You stay beside Avery until the auction ends. By then, several guests have smiled at you and spoken to you without first checking who you came with.
	<<if C.npc.Avery.love gte 60 and C.npc.Avery.rage lt 20>>
		"You cleaned up well. I might even bring you to the next one."
		<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
		"Adequate. You embarrassed yourself less than usual."
	<<else>>
		"You served your purpose. Which, tonight, is almost praise."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Good
<<effects>><<person1>>
The auction ends and guests begin collecting their coats. Some stay behind to finish their drinks or make one last introduction before leaving.
<br><br>
Avery leads you back downstairs through the now-quiet bank. <<He>> keeps one hand at the small of your back as you walk.
<br><br>
<<if !$avery_mansion.hbsc_gala_seen>>
	Near the entrance, a silver-haired <<person4>><<person>> in a charcoal suit steps forward. <<He>> wears a foundation badge on <<his>> lapel.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks at Avery first, then at you. "I don't believe we've been introduced. And you are...?"
	<br><br>
	Avery presses <<his>> hand more firmly against your back. "Mine," <<person1>><<he>> says. After a short pause, <<he>> adds, "From the orphanage. But presentable, as you can see."
	<br><br>
	The <<person4>><<person>> gives you a polite smile. "Then you qualify for a grant from the foundation." <<He>> takes out a small card and writes on it. "We'll transfer <<printmoney `divineTfIncome(300000, "avery")`>> to your HBSC savings. The bank's charter allows for it."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> nods once to Avery and steps aside.
	<br><br>

	/* Charity payout; deposited to HBSC savings, respects tier deposit cap */
	<<set _xferResult to setup.hbsc.receiveExternalDeposit(divineTfIncome(300000, "avery"))>>
	<<if _xferResult.overflow>>
		<span class="red">Your HBSC savings couldn't take the full transfer. The rest was added to the cash you're carrying.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.hbsc_gala_seen to true>>
<<else>>
	Near the entrance, the same silver-haired <<person4>><<person>> from the foundation is waiting by the door. <<He>> sees you coming and gives a familiar nod.
	"Back again. I'll have the usual transferred to your account." <<He>> nods towards Avery. "The foundation's compliments, as always."
	<br><br>
	Avery smiles at that.<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
	<br><br>

	/* Repeat charity payout; respects tier deposit cap */
	<<set _xferResult to setup.hbsc.receiveExternalDeposit(divineTfIncome(300000, "avery"))>>
	<<if _xferResult.overflow>>
		<span class="red">Your HBSC savings couldn't take the full transfer. The rest was added to the cash you're carrying.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Good 2]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Good 2
<<effects>><<pass 120>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
"A productive evening," Avery says as you step outside. "You looked presentable, followed direction, and came away with something interesting. I might even be in a generous mood."
<br><br>
"The guest I originally invited has only been delayed," <<he>> adds. "They'll be the guest of honour at the next party."
<br><br>
A servant holds the car door open. The cool night air feels good after hours inside the crowded bank, and you settle into the car for the ride back to the mansion.
<br><br><<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_party_end>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet
<<effects>>
By the time the last applause ends, your feet ache and your face hurts from smiling at people all evening.
<br><br>
<<if !$avery_mansion.hbsc_gala_seen>>
	On the way out, a silver-haired <<person4>><<person>> in a charcoal suit stops you both. <<He>> looks you over, then turns to Avery.
	<br><br>
	"One moment," <<he>> says to Avery. "Your companion... from the orphanage, I'm told?"
	<br><br>
	Avery gives <<person1>><<him>> a small nod. The <<person4>><<person>> takes out a card and writes some numbers on it. "The foundation has approved a grant. <<printmoney `divineTfIncome(300000, "avery")`>> will be transferred to their HBSC savings." <<He>> puts the card back into <<his>> pocket. "Good evening to you both."
	<br><br>

	/* Charity payout; deposited to HBSC savings, respects tier deposit cap */
	<<set _xferResult to setup.hbsc.receiveExternalDeposit(divineTfIncome(300000, "avery"))>>
	<<if _xferResult.overflow>>
		<span class="red">Your HBSC savings couldn't take the full transfer. The rest was added to the cash you're carrying.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.hbsc_gala_seen to true>>
<<else>>
	The silver-haired <<person4>><<person>> from the foundation stops you near the exit. "The usual <<printmoney `divineTfIncome(300000, "avery")`>>," <<he>> says with a brief nod. "Do come again."
	<br><br>

	/* Repeat charity payout; respects tier deposit cap */
	<<set _xferResult to setup.hbsc.receiveExternalDeposit(divineTfIncome(300000, "avery"))>>
	<<if _xferResult.overflow>>
		<span class="red">Your HBSC savings couldn't take the full transfer. The rest was added to the cash you're carrying.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet 2]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Quiet 2
<<effects>><<pass 120>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<person1>>Avery walks out with you, looking pleased with how the evening went. "Not perfect," <<he>> says. "But no disasters. In this city, that puts you ahead of most people with money."
<br><br>
"The guest I originally invited has only been delayed," <<he>> adds. "They'll be the guest of honour at the next party."
<br><br>
You leave the bank thinking about everything you heard and saw during the evening.
<br><br><<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_party_end>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>

:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala End Bad
<<effects>><<pass 120>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
You spend the rest of the gala beside Avery. <<He>> keeps you close, and after what happened, you speak only when someone addresses you.
<br><br>
When you finally leave, Avery does not offer <<his>> arm.
"You will be useful to me again," <<he>> says as the car door shuts. "Next time, remember the difference between taking the lead and doing something stupid."
<br><br>
"The guest I originally invited has only been delayed. They'll be the guest of honour at the next party. Do not embarrass me twice."
<br><br>
The ride back to the mansion feels much longer than the journey there.
<br><br><<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_party_end>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>
